@[basesystem step]
In this step, you will unpack and install the basesystem image to your target
partitions, and then install the spell caches you selected in the
@[spell-caches] step into it.

enchantment:
  @[enchantment install basesystem]
  @[enchantment install caches]

manually:
  @[tar -xpf /system.tar.xz -C "$ENCHANT_TARGET"]
  copy the caches you want to $ENCHANT_TARGET/var/cache/sorcery/, then
  @[enchantment chroot] and @[cast] the spells, and @[exit]

If all goes well, you will have a very minimal base system that you can now
play around in.

When you are ready, type @[next].
